n...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hsFtcQ8eL-UQ7kNvwHRRfkB&_nc_oc=AdoUakTwAfpYdTR11uahzULpolLWPtZcr6oPzX0ZS0tHCDREU9O-V1oCBeIJbOMs7-0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9LAtggxLKlobiqZxslo2wxes6eA8mUp-auBJ4m1TQxCg&oe=6A396287"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=63Syabkzi3QQ7kNvwErVNom&_nc_oc=AdpVvispra4L244H3ZQ4NjmlOl9hD7sarpFYIRAItRj_UCs6vkunhqNzE6Vh9pj5rhQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_3RgvWFYuqz2Ewa2hMCeHDtyioDFlc2BXFXD-rCNCosw&oe=6A3937FC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bF1AZ3PdH-IQ7kNvwFYt_-j&_nc_oc=AdoOACr9euJ32VVFJ1wOuz2A2x7JQvunPDaDddEkFLmbl06J2sdbGoBDzcEDe8Nc7FY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af879O2L0EsOYpx7-lLQ48GLDyet_vvRmE8u6PNxMEXs9g&oe=6A39616B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_446